  "releaseNotes": "v3.1.4 stable: Transitive dep-bump to SpawnDev.RTC 1.1.4 to force the browser `BrowserRtpSender.SetParameters` codecs-required-present fix through the chain for consumers with lock files or explicit version pins. No source changes in SpawnDev.WebTorrent itself. See SpawnDev.RTC 1.1.4 release notes for the fix, and 3.1.3 notes for the big BEP 44/46 + pure-v2 + EnsureDhtAsync feature bundle (unchanged in content). See CHANGELOG.md for per-rc breakdown.",
